    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L11-ACTIVITY-002",
      "SourceSection": "11.1: Rewind to the Windmill",
      "SourceExcerpt": "What do you think Priya means by rotating \\(\\text- \\frac \\pi 2\\) radians? Do you agree with Priya? Be prepared to explain your reasoning.",
